{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"阿摩司书","commonName":"阿摩司书","title":"阿摩司书","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"42c4027397b1c6cfa551ec206eda319190accd30126769b0ef64f13ff07a4bf7","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你们住撒马利亚山如巴珊母牛的啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当听我的话—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们欺负贫寒的，压碎穷乏的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对家主说：拿酒来，我们喝吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华指着自己的圣洁起誓说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日子快到，人必用钩子将你们钩去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用鱼钩将你们余剩的钩去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们各人必从破口直往前行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"投入哈门。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的失败"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"以色列人哪，任你们往伯特利去犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到吉甲加增罪过；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每日早晨献上你们的祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每三日奉上你们的十分之一。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任你们献有酵的感谢祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把甘心祭宣传报告给众人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为是你们所喜爱的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我使你们在一切城中牙齿干净，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你们各处粮食缺乏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们仍不归向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"在收割的前三月，我使雨停止，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不降在你们那里；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我降雨在这城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不降雨在那城；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这块地有雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那块地无雨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无雨的就枯干了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样，两三城的人凑到一城去找水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却喝不足；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们仍不归向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"我以旱风、霉烂攻击你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们园中许多菜蔬、葡萄树、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无花果树、橄榄树都被剪虫所吃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们仍不归向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"我降瘟疫在你们中间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在埃及一样；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用刀杀戮你们的少年人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们的马匹被掳掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"营中尸首的臭气扑鼻；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们仍不归向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"我倾覆你们中间的城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同我从前倾覆所多玛、蛾摩拉一样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们好像从火中抽出来的一根柴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们仍不归向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，我必向你如此行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，我既这样行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你当预备迎见你的 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"那创山、造风、将心意指示人、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使晨光变为幽暗、脚踏在地之高处的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的名是耶和华—万军之 神。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/AMO/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/AMO/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/AMO/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}